> ## 🎯 Yaad Rakhne Ka Asaan Formula
>
> **Facility = "Log kis Department ya Service ne generate kiya?"**
>
> **Priority = "Log kitna serious ya important hai?"**
>
> **Destination = "Log kis file ya location mein store hoga?"**
>
> ### Simple Formula:
>
> ```text
> Facility.Priority      Destination
> ```
>
> **Example:**
>
> ```text
> authpriv.*      /var/log/secure
> ```
>
> Matlab:
>
> Authentication ke tamam messages `/var/log/secure` mein save karo.

